Package: isocountry
Title: ISO 3166-1 Country, ISO 4217 Currency, and ISO 10383 Market
    Identifier Codes
Version: 0.8.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Maximilian", "Mücke", , "muecke.maximilian@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-9432-9795"))
Description: ISO 3166-1 country codes combined with United Nations M49
    regional classifications and membership status in the OECD, the
    European Union (EU), the Economic and Monetary Union (EMU), and the
    European Economic Area (EEA), along with current and historic ISO
    4217 currency codes for each country, and ISO 10383 market
    identifier codes (MICs) for exchanges and other trading venues.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://m-muecke.github.io/isocountry/,
    https://github.com/m-muecke/isocountry
BugReports: https://github.com/m-muecke/isocountry/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
    tibble
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    testthat (>= 3.3.0)
Config/roxygen2/markdown: TRUE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
